e same agent. Never use `nohup`, shell `&`, `disown`, redirected fire-and-forget processes, or a detached terminal witho
ut an explicit verified callback merely to keep polling alive. If the harness has no completion-aware background facilit
y, use the foreground poll or first wire a verified wake callback into the surrounding supervisor. Do not tell the user
